{{Noticebox/Official}}

'''Moonchaser''' was a free [[VRChat]] music [[Events|event]] on {{Date|2026-08-28}}, hosted in {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0cc30ae5-1a58-4984-a2d5-e466bd0349dc|Moonchaser 2026}}.<ref name="DU2026-08-13">[https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-13-august-2026/48800 "Developer Update - 13 August 2026"] on ''ask.vrchat.com''; dated August 13, 2026; retrieved August 13, 2026.</ref><ref name="MoonchaserLanding">[https://www.discovervr.chat/moonchaser "Moonchaser"] on ''discovervr.chat''; retrieved August 31, 2026.</ref>

== Format ==

DJ sets and performances were broadcast to every instance of the Moonchaser world at once. Instances other than the DJ's showed a hologram of the DJ.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20">[https://x.com/VRChat/status/2090512905825345711 Post] on ''x.com''; posted August 20, 2026; retrieved August 21, 2026.</ref><ref name="MoonchaserLanding" /><ref name="DU2026-08-27">[https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-27-august-2026/48877 "Developer Update - 27 August 2026"] on ''ask.vrchat.com''; dated August 27, 2026; retrieved August 27, 2026.</ref>

The event ran from {{DateTime|2026-08-28 18:00}} PDT to {{DateTime|2026-08-28 23:00}} PDT.<ref name="MoonchaserLanding" /><ref name="MoonchaserLandingJA">[https://www.discovervr.chat/moonchaser/ja "Moonchaser"] (Japanese) on ''discovervr.chat''; retrieved August 31, 2026.</ref> It was available on all [[Platforms|platforms]], including desktop and mobile clients, and was streamed at [https://www.twitch.tv/vrchat twitch.tv/vrchat].<ref name="MoonchaserLanding" /><ref name="DU2026-08-27" /><ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20" />

A [[Quick Menu]] banner and a [[Worlds#World categories|World Row]] linked to the world while the event was live.<ref name="MoonchaserLanding" /><ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20" />

== Schedule ==

Sets were hourly in PDT.<ref name="MoonchaserLanding" />

* {{Time|18:00}}: {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_b8b7e80a-a2dd-48c0-b493-3806a2f7c2e0|Clyde Machine}} and {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_e9217838-7cd9-4475-9e55-36cf58896cca|Softly Steph}}
* {{Time|19:00}}: {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_c6421975-f85d-4aa3-b24a-3873a8d0b38e|3Marco}}
* {{Time|20:00}}: {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_86dd60ac-1137-4de1-a96a-98036c2e385e|Sera Akai}}
* {{Time|21:00}}: {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_135bb8b3-0738-40e6-8db0-dc0f6c24be3e|Naku}} and {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_5eaffa64-94bb-45b1-9681-b92d9cfe7ec3|Sir Rose}}
* {{Time|22:00}}: {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_3b40e78a-460f-44a3-bea1-4593a96c2c39|Yoru019}} (よる_Yoru019)

Softly Steph and Sir Rose were billed as VJs.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserLineupX2026-08-20">[https://x.com/VRChat/status/2090512907633090814 Post] on ''x.com''; posted August 20, 2026; retrieved August 21, 2026.</ref><ref name="MoonchaserLanding" />

== Rewards ==

Three rewards were available during the event.<ref name="MoonchaserLanding" />

{| class="wikitable"
|-
! !! Reward !! Type !! Requirement
|-
| [[File:Accessory Moonchaser Wristband.png|frameless|70x70px]] || Moonchaser Wristband || [[Accessories|Accessory]] || Granted on joining any Moonchaser instance
|-
| [[File:Accessory Moonchaser Shades.png|frameless|70x70px]] || Moonchaser Shades || [[Accessories|Accessory]] || One hour total in Moonchaser instances, including time spent moving between instances
|-
| [[File:Prop Moonchaser Penlight.png|frameless|70x70px]] || Moonchaser Penlight || [[Items|Item]] (Twitch Drop) || Thirty minutes watching the official VRChat Twitch channel, not required to be one continuous set; [[Account Linking]] between Twitch and VRChat was required
|}

VRChat reported technical issues distributing the Shades, then stated that everyone who received a Wristband would also receive Shades.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserShadesIssuesBsky">[https://bsky.app/profile/vrchat.com/post/3mu6tvibcus2g Post] on ''bsky.app''; posted August 29, 2026; retrieved August 31, 2026.</ref><ref name="VRChatMoonchaserShadesGrantBsky">[https://bsky.app/profile/vrchat.com/post/3mu6wdnuil22p Post] on ''bsky.app''; posted August 29, 2026; retrieved August 31, 2026.</ref><ref name="VRChatMoonchaserWrapBsky">[https://bsky.app/profile/vrchat.com/post/3mu77afenac2t Post] on ''bsky.app''; posted August 29, 2026; retrieved August 31, 2026.</ref>

== History ==

On {{Date|2026-06-22}}, VRChat opened a public interest check for performers and venues for a planned platform-wide event that would broadcast beyond standard instances.<ref name="VRChatMusicInterestBsky">[https://bsky.app/profile/vrchat.com/post/3movpjgim422n "Music Performance Interest"] post on ''bsky.app''; posted June 22, 2026; retrieved June 22, 2026.</ref><ref name="VRChatEventForm">[https://forms.gle/sgGRLYr6XAqhv5K89 "VRChat Event — Performer & Venue Interest"] application form on ''forms.gle''; retrieved June 22, 2026.</ref> The {{Date|2026-07-30}} Developer Update referred to an unnamed event around August's lunar eclipse.<ref name="DU2026-07-30">[https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-30-july-2026/48750 "Developer Update - 30 July 2026"] on ''ask.vrchat.com''; dated July 30, 2026; retrieved August 13, 2026.</ref> On {{Date|2026-08-13}}, VRChat named the event Moonchaser for {{Date|2026-08-28}}.<ref name="DU2026-08-13" /> On {{Date|2026-08-20}}, VRChat posted the world, start time, lineup, and rewards.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20" /><ref name="VRChatMoonchaserLineupX2026-08-20" /> On {{Date|2026-08-29}}, after the scheduled end, VRChat posted a wrap-up on Bluesky.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserWrapBsky" />

